XaiBoot Debian 13 rescue environment

Desktop is installed but not started automatically.
Start it with: xaidesktop

Quick help: xaihelp
Logs: journalctl -b, dmesg -T, /var/log/
Networking: nmcli device, sudo nmtui
Storage: lsblk, blkid, fdisk, parted, gdisk, gparted
Hardware: lshw, lscpu, lspci, lsusb, dmidecode, smartctl, nvme
